915	         *  Segments which match the following criteria are eligible for copying to remote storage:
916	         *  1) Segment is not the active segment and
917	         *  2) Segment end-offset is less than the last-stable-offset as remote storage should contain only
918	         *     committed/acked messages
919	         * @param log The log from which the segments are to be copied
920	         * @param fromOffset The offset from which the segments are to be copied
921	         * @param lastStableOffset The last stable offset of the log
